  "summary": "Malicious code in casino-boomerang (npm)",
  "details": "Casino-boomerang@1.0.0 is a casino-affiliate spam package. It ships an empty module (module.exports = {}) with no functional code, no install scripts, and no dependencies. Its README is Czech-language search-engine-optimization content promoting \"Boomerang Casino\" and linking to boomerang-betcasino[.]cz, with an image hosted on i[.]ibb[.]co. The package is part of a bulk-published casino-promotion spam campaign; this version contains no executable payload.",
